window.products.push({"id":424007,"name":"WOBILOO Glass Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle With Silicone Brush 2 In 1, Silicone Dropper Measuring Oil Dispenser Bottle for Kitchen Cooking, Frying, Baki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51793UyVZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique 2 in 1 design: The silicone dropper and brush are made of food-grade PP. The three-layer short-bristle brush has no peculiar smell, no deformation, no hair loss, and a heat-resistant temperature of up to 250 degrees Celsius. The oil dispenser is made of borosilicate glass, which is durable and not easily broken. Easy to use: The measuring bottle with brush mouth itself is large, so you can easily pour oil, vinegar, chili oil, etc. The glass oil dropper bottle can be used for cooking, baking, frying, storage and brushing, and it can also be used for outdoor picnics, and it is convenient to carry. Can control the amount of oil: Just a slight pinch, you can quickly enter the oil, and the precise scale allows you to control the quantitative oil output. Moreover, the design of the oil return hole also avoids waste and overflow, while also ensuring the cleanliness of the table. Easy to clean: Each part can be disassembled and cleaned separately, and the dispenser is easy to install. The brush can also be used alone, and it is very convenient to apply ketchup, chocolate sauce, and peanut butter. 2 Oil Brush & 2 Straw：Brushes and straws are broken, you can always replace the new brushes and straws. Package includes:1* Oil dispenser bottle, 2* Silicone oil brush, 2* Straw, 1* Instruction manual. If you have any issue with our oil dispenser bottle for kitchen, please don't hesitate to contact us, we will try our best to find a satisfactory solution for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51793UyVZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOBILOO","source_asin":"B0B4NMZF6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4NMZF6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4NMZF6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
