window.products.push({"id":424135,"name":"Dalstrong Non Stick Frying Pan Skillet - 10 inch - The Oberon Series - ETERNA NonStick Pan Coating - 2 QT - 3-Ply Aluminum Core Cookware - Silver Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61msor3pojL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dalstrong Oberon Series 10” ETERNA non-stick skillet is thoughtfully designed for optimal pan-searing, pan-roasting and frying. The heavy gauge 3-Ply Aluminum-Core construction conducts heat evenly for consistent results. Eterna coating maintains non-stick properties 26X longer than the leading competitor, and 10x longer than other premium non-stick brands. The glass lid lets you see what’s cooking. ETERNA Nonstick coating — Dalstrong used an extra thick coating for our nonstick to ensure longevity and durability. The 35 micrometers thick ETERNA Nonstick coating lasts 26X longer than the leading competitor, 10x longer than other premium non-stick brands. Enjoy safer, healthier cooking with more durable nonstick coating. 3-PLY ALUMINUM CORE & 18/10 STAINLESS STEEL CLADDING — for optimized heat conductivity, control, and responsiveness. Excel at searing, with cookware that gets hot fast. Layers of smudge-free aluminum & 18/10 stainless steel above and below the Aluminum Forged Foundation provide maximum durability and easy maintenance. These layers protect the incredible temperature control and speed of the copper core with durability and longevity. TRUE HEAVY GAUGE — Ultra strong 2.5mm thickness that will never dent or warp under prolonged heat, for consistent cooking results every time. Oberon cookware sets include true heavy gauge pots, pans, and lids. Heavy gauge cookware is strong, durable, and cooks foods evenly. The bottom stays perfectly flat for even heat distribution. MESS-FREE POURING — The flared lip creates the perfect drip-free pour, for easier dishing up and serving of sauces and stir fries. Savor every drop of sauce or broth from stir fries, soups, and any other dishes poured from Dalstrong cookware. The skillets, pans, and pots all have a flared lip for a clean pour that lands where you want it. ERGONOMIC HANDLES — All of the handles in Oberon pots, pans, and skillets, are made to be ergonomic. Designed to accommodate a professional chef's underhand grip, the perfectly angled handles ensure a comfortable and secure hold while cooking. Never drop or spill a dish again, thanks to handles that are easy to grip even while wearing oven mitts. Easily maneuver these pots and pans from stovetop to oven or table. Engraved side handles add control, maneuverability, and prestige. INDESTRUCTIBLE VENTED LID — Strong, stainless steel lids will last a lifetime and maintain a perfect seal. The vented hole releases pressure to prevent rattling and food from boiling over. Each piece of Oberon cookware features a perfect fit lid. Enjoy the perfect omelet, frittata, rice, or sauce with the heat-retaining, moisture-preserving effect of a perfect fit lid. COMPATIBLE AND INCORRUPTIBLE — The Dalstrong Oberon series is compatible with all stovetops, as well as oven and broiler safe up to 800 degrees F (500 degrees for the nonstick line). Brave the elements: freezer, dishwasher, and refrigerator safe. Oberon pots and pans can be used over an open flame, propane stove, induction stovetop, and more. Oberon cookware is made from non-toxic, hypoallergenic materials that are PFOA and PTFE free, and the stainless steel surface is ultra-durable. LIFETIME WARRANTY against defects. Rocksolid 100% SATISFACTION OR MONEY BACK GUARANTEE, try it risk free. Comes with renowned Dalstrong customer service and nearly 100,000 5-star reviews. Over one million orders have been fulfilled so far. See why chefs around the world trust and love, 'The Dalstrong Difference'.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61msor3pojL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalstrong","source_asin":"B09SJ1HWLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SJ1HWLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SJ1HWLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
