window.products.push({"id":424139,"name":"ABOCIDE Custom Zebra Roller Shades, Dual Layer Zebra Blinds for Windows, Roller Window Shades, Light Control for Day & Night (Grey, Custom Size)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O8LYF7QfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Customized solution: we provide plenty of choices to fit your window sizes. You can choose the Color and Material Type first. Then click \"Customize Now\" on the upper right to find more size choices.Our shades are suitable for Living room, bedroom, dining room, school, office, multimedia demostration room, etc. VERY IMPORTANT,PLEASE ATTENTION:Each custom product is made specifically to specifications in your order. SO PLEPLEASE READ THROUGH ALL THE SELECTION GUIDE AND MEASURE YOUR WINDOW CORRECTLY SO YOU CAN CALCULATE THE FITTEST SHADES SIZE. MAKE SURE ALL INFORMATION IS CORRECT before you proceed to purchase. Environmentally friendly fabrics and design: Double Layered Zebra Roller Shades are woven with high quality polyester fabric, which combined sheer mesh and opaque dual layers, easily switch between sheer and opaque layers. High quality polyester fabric gently filters light while providing privacy. By pulling the zebra blinds to freely adjust the room light. Zebra roller blinds will enhance the performance and appearance in home/office/kitchen/bedroom/living room/bathroom(Shading degree 85%). Smooth And Silent Slide: Our products include high-quality aluminum alloy upper rail and thickened cassette box which is matching the valance fabric in color, and applied precision gear for noise reduction. You can roll it up and down smoothly and quietly. It is not easy to get rust and damage. According to our laboratory test, our rope can be easily pulled up and down for around 5000 times and maintained smooth. Delivery and customer service: It usually takes 2-4 business days after you confirmed the order for us to complete the customised production. Please note that the international shipping will normally take 7 to 10 business days, which may vary depending on the final destination address.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O8LYF7QfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABOCIDE","source_asin":"B0B2DXQG4S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2DXQG4S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2DXQG4S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
