window.products.push({"id":424243,"name":"Cilio 18/10 Stainless Steel Wine Sealer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZJpAgYVKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEPS WINE FRESH LONGER: There is nothing more disappointing than discovering that your delicious bottle of wine has lost flavor due to oxidation. When you need an easy way to safeguard your high quality wines, it's time to try the Cilio Stainless Steel Wine Sealer, the wine bottle topper and sealer that really seals your bottles airtight. SUPERIOR QUALITY BOTTLE SEALER: This stainless steel wine bottle sealer has been manufactured in the German tradition of the Cilio brand. Made with a brushed stainless steel shell, it is built to deliver a leak-proof seal every time. This bottle stopper will become one of your favorite wine accessories. As beautiful as it is functional, you'll wonder how you ever got along without it! LEAK-PROOF SIDE STORAGE: The Cilio wine bottle sealer's sealing mechanism allows you to store wine in the fridge without worrying about mess or leaking. The airtight seal is designed to be 100% leak-proof, even when the bottle is lying down. Aside from the side storage convenience, the flat top ensures that your bottles will still fit perfectly in your wine refrigerator EASY TO USE: Our bottle sealer is quick and uncomplicated for busy people who don’t want to fuss with difficult sealers. Simply place the wine sealer over the top of your unfinished bottle and pull the sealer down over the bottle opening until it snaps in place, providing a leak-proof seal. When you are ready to have your next glass of wine, just press down on the sealer's top button and remove. It’s that easy! CILIO TRADITION OF QUALITY: Cilio, a partner of Frieling for more than two decades, is well known for making quality tabletop, serving, and bar accessories. They place great emphasis on combining timeless design and functionality to bring you the highest quality products, and this philosophy of greatness runs throughout their entire product line.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZJpAgYVKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cilio","source_asin":"B0788BNKJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0788BNKJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0788BNKJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":424244,"name":"Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer, Wood Kitchen Food Baggie Dispenser Box for Drawer, Compatible with Most Brands Gallon Bag, Quart Bag, Sandwich Bag, Sna","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618BKHZbQGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE MORNING EASIER --- Ready for something you never knew you needed? I can’t even tell you how nice it is to look in my drawer and see this instead of all the random, half-torn falling apart boxes shoved in there! There's just something so pleasing to see this nice and tidy, cute organizer every time you need to make breakfast. TWO INSTALLATION METHODS --- Hang on the wall or put it inside a drawer. Each organizer we build is designed with mounting holes in the back panel just in case you want to place it on a wall or the side of your Kitchen cabinet. ASSEMBLED --- Units come assembled so all you have to do is fill with your favorite bags and stop dropping boxes while digging out the right size. PERFECT SIZE --- The box is 11.4” square, 2.75” tall, and holds the standard box amount of bags in each section. Organize your storage bags with ease. Fits in most drawers to finally have all your bags in one organized place. Fits a full standard size box in each slot. AFTER-SALES SERVICE --- 30 days return policy guarantee against any product defects guarantee. Any questions, feel free to contact us. You will have a perfect shopping experience. Now Click \"Add to Cart\", ready for making your drawer neat again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618BKHZbQGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Losvio","source_asin":"B0BQWC1D6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQWC1D6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQWC1D6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
