window.products.push({"id":424296,"name":"Coffee Travel Mug for Car - 16oz Insulated Coffee Cup - One Press to Open Leak - Coffee Tumbler - Leak-free Stainless Steel Tumbler for Ice Drinks and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HBSqt6yZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"JUST ONE PRESS opens the spout of your car travel mug/coffee cup to drink on the go! Seriously? No joke! Our 16 oz stainless steel cups were designed to help you easily enjoy every sip without spilling a drop! HERE’s how our travel coffee cup is different: 1. HASSLE-FREE, ONE-PRESS DRINKING: Simply press the button and drink! No splashing, no accidental spills. Drinking with one hand while driving during rush hour in the city is easy with our coffee mug with lid/stainless steel cup.  2. ALWAYS THE RIGHT TEMPERATURE AND TASTE: Thanks to advanced vacuum insulation technology, our iced coffee cup/stainless steel coffee mug can retain heat for up to 6 hours and keep your drink cold for up to 12 hours. Electric interior polishing prevents rust formation and the penetration of undesired flavors. Savor the genuine taste.  3. NO SPILLS, NO LEAKS: Even if you turn our travel tumbler upside down, shake it from side to side or simply toss it into your carry bag, this stainless steel mug will NEVER spoil your mood, clothes or bags. The sealed leak-and-spill-proof lid will securely keep your beverage inside your insulated coffee travel mug.  4.EXCELLENT ACCESSORY IN YOUR STYLE: This insulated travel mug looks fancy and cool. Colleagues and friends will immediately notice your new, exquisite thermos cup.  5.PRACTICAL SOLUTION: Our double wall tumbler is excellent for both daily commuting and on long trips. The easy-care design and graded surface guarantee smooth handling. This thermos cup is light weight, easy to clean and dishwasher safe.  We stand by the quality of our insulated tumbler with lid! If you have any issues, let us know and we’ll do our best to fix them. Order our coffee travel mug NOW and enjoy ONE-PRESS, leak-free drinking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HBSqt6yZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"aciess","source_asin":"B07TY7B76V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TY7B76V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TY7B76V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
