window.products.push({"id":424324,"name":"Electric Small Stove,500W Small Hot Plates For Cooking Electric Single Electric Flat Cast Iron Heating Plate Burner for RV, Small Apartments, Camping ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f+cRmsCcL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"First use: Turn on the machine and heat it for 3-5 minutes in the fifth gear. At this time, a small amount of smoke may be exhausted because of the evaporation of the protective film on the furnace surface. This is a normal phenomenon. Turn on the fifth gear and continue heating for more than 10 minutes at a time, and then basically disappear after 2-3 times Up to 570°C/1000°F: A small stove with a power of 500 watts can be used for hot water, soup, and coffee Approximately 6 inches in diameter: Compatible with 6 inches to 10 inches cooking utensils, portable small stoves can replace induction cookers in travel, vacation, RV, camping Five levels of temperature adjustable: Rotate the electric furnace knob switch, there are 5 positions to adjust the temperature of the electric furnace. Adjust the switch to the appropriate position to make the electric furnace reach the required temperature. Note that when not in use, please set the switch to \"0\"/\" \"Off\" position and unplug Note: The red light under the shell will go out when the electric furnace reaches the temperature you adjusted. The red light will be on when the temperature is lower than the temperature you adjusted. It will work in cycles and automatically keep warm. When the electric furnace is not in use, be sure to turn the switch to \"0\"/\"OFF\" position, and unplug it, do not immerse the electric stove in water or other liquids","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f+cRmsCcL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lelukee","source_asin":"B08FJDF5XT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FJDF5XT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FJDF5XT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":424325,"name":"Drtupe Super Mario Warp Pipe Mug Ceramic Coffee Mug Gift for Gamers, Fathers, Coffee Enthusiasts, for Cappuccino, Latte or Hot Tea, 15 Oz, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zmamBL1dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Recommended as the idea for Christmas gift, Mothers day, Fathers day, Valentine’s day, mugs for coworkers, kids mug, funny mug, unique coffee mugs, novelty coffee mugs. PRINTED ON BOTH SIDES. It doesn’t matter how you hold the mug, this awesome design will always be seen. If you like, you can dress the mug up even more for gifting by placing additional gifts inside, such as stickers, magnets, candies, and chocolates, or coffee grounds and tea bags. Why not give the best? The best gifts are both personal and functional, and that’s why this awesome, Super Mario Mug is a fantastic choice for nearly any occasion. Whether you are treating yourself or giving as a gift to your mom, dad, girlfriend, boyfriend, friend, or work colleague, know that few things can make people happier than holding a cup of hot coffee or tea. They will remember you each time they take a sip from their favorite mug! If you are a fan of the Super Mario anime and gaming series, you will enjoy your morning coffee with this exclusive Super Mario Pipe Mug ceramic coffee mug and profess your love of the Super Mario Bros video game. Specifications: - Material: Ceramics. - Size & weight: + 4.7 x 3.42 x 4.7 inches，15 oz（About 450ml） Package Content: Super Mario Pipe mug x 1. Packing box x 1. Pay attention : Due to manual measurement, please allow 0.5-1cm error. Make sure you don't mind bidding. Since filming techniques / ambient light / display color and other reasons may cause the pictures to be slightly off color, please make the final color prevail in kind. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zmamBL1dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Drtupe","source_asin":"B096F3VYPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096F3VYPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096F3VYPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":424326,"name":"Etched Mikey Moon Wood Wine Stopper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316eBXT9qAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Save your leftover wine with this Wooden Wine Stopper etched with the image of Mikey under a Crescent Moon. It fits most wine bottles, and may also be useful at shows where they take away your water bottle caps if it fits. Comes with velvet pouch with a drawstring. WineO functions better than cork, a no-taste, no-odor food grade thermoplastic elastomer (TPE) shank eliminates the concerns of cork crumbs and the oxygen permeability. The patented design and low profile topper allow horizontal or vertical placement of open bottles for storage flexibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316eBXT9qAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WSMFP","source_asin":"B01J57QGS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J57QGS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J57QGS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
