window.products.push({"id":424328,"name":"Oregon Rectangle Notary Stamp -OR Official Notary Stamp - Enter Custom Text","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qlBWd45tL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our notary stamps are ideal for new or renewing notaries public. We offer custom options that make creating your own notary stamp quick and easy. Each notary stamp is made to meet your state’s standards. State requirements vary on text, ink color, emblem design, and more. Based on the state you practice in, you may need to include information like your name, license number, and expiration date on your impression. Our stamps come pre-assembled, so you will be ready to notarize documents as soon as you receive your order! Why shop 904 Custom? We provide easy custom options in our listing, so you don’t have to wait to hear back from us after you order! Simply click “customize now” and add in your state specified information. Once you check out, expect your personalized notary stamp in 1-2 business days! It’s that easy. What is a Self-Inking Stamp? Self-inking stamps have an internal ink pad. With each impression the design is pressed up against the ink pad and then flipped back down to leave a quality impression on your paper. This mechanism makes self-inking stamps perfect for rapid stamping, allowing you to easily imprint large piles of paperwork in minutes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qlBWd45tL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"904 Custom","source_asin":"B07SWM59BP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SWM59BP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SWM59BP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
