window.products.push({"id":424347,"name":"Shaxori NEW 4-in-1 Rapid Defrosting Tray Cutting Board| Extra Thick 9mm Thawing Tray for Fast Defrosting Power| Dethawing Plate Chopping Board for Fro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sOKmPcClS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When it comes to our customer’s satisfaction, there’s no room for compromise. That’s why Shaxori works only with top quality materials, innovative designs and verified suppliers, which are guaranteed to deliver to our high expectations. If by some reason you’re not entirely pleased with your purchase, our customer care department has got you covered! Defrost, Cut, Chop and Dice With Our Multifunctional Kitchen Tray The Shaxori frozen food defrosting tray is definitely a must in every well-equipped and modern kitchen, providing a safe and durable setting for preparing and defrosting your meats, vegetables, fruits and more! Made with aviation aluminum and non-stick coating, with built-in knife sharpener and surface grater, plus a lightweight and ergonomic design, this cutting board will instantly become your favorite kitchen utensil! Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product: Set includes silicone sponge and basting brush for marinading; Set includes silicone sponge and basting brush for marinading; Materials: aviation aluminum, non-stick coating, polypropylene, thermoplastic rubber; Materials: aviation aluminum, non-stick coating, polypropylene, thermoplastic rubber; Surface grater ideal for ginger or garlic; Surface grater ideal for ginger or garlic; Knife sharpener restores and sharpens dull kitchen knives; Knife sharpener restores and sharpens dull kitchen knives; Rapidly defrost meats and vegetables; Rapidly defrost meats and vegetables; Durable cutting board for slicing, chopping, mincing and dicing; Durable cutting board for slicing, chopping, mincing and dicing; Food-grade and non-toxic; Food-grade and non-toxic; Thoughtful present for friends and loved ones. Thoughtful present for friends and loved ones. Make your life easier while cooking with this premium thawing tray!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sOKmPcClS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08T1TLJ1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T1TLJ1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T1TLJ1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":424348,"name":"VLove Lightweight Cordless Electric Wine Bottle Opener with Removable Foil Cutter and Acrylic Corkscrew Perfect for Wine Gift Set,Restaurant,Hotel,Par","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-WZLE0otL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The only Wine Bottle Opener you will ever need. Electronic & Effortless. Everybody loves wine, but one of the worst things about wine is getting through the cork and seal properly. How many times your party has been spoiled by the cork falling into the wine, or not able to be removed, because of a bad bottle opener?!  We have created this Electronic Wine Bottle opener to take all the guesswork and difficulty out of drinking wine. The VLove’s new Electronic Bottle Opener houses the corkscrew in an acrylic shell, so there is zero guesswork and no chance of getting hurt. Make opening any bottle of wine fun, fast and extra safe! Our product runs on batteries, so you never have to worry about unwieldy cords and cables getting in the way. It's also housed in a beautiful metal and acrylic container that keeps your hands safe as you pop open your bottles of wine. All material used are solid and high-quality to ensure a long lasting life of this product and your safety. Ergonomic design for an easy handling, light weight (12.5 ounces) and optimal dimensions (10.6 x 2.8 x 2.8 inches). How to use the Electric Wine Bottle Opener: 1. Put the foil cutter on the bottle's neck. Tighten and spin it to turn & cut foil.  2. Put the wine opener over the bottle's neck, let the corkscrew drill into the center of the cork.  3. Continue pressing the lower button until it stops.  4. Press and hold the upper button until the cork is pulled out automatically. What’s in the Package: 1 x Electronic Wine Opener 1 x Wine Foil Cutter 1 x Power Cable(Charge Adapter not included) Attention: 1. Keep it away from children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-WZLE0otL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VLove","source_asin":"B075ZSKPN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075ZSKPN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075ZSKPN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
