window.products.push({"id":424387,"name":"Kids Alarm Clock, Digital Alarm Clock for Kids Bedroom, Dinosaur Digital Alarm Clock with App Control and 6 Kinds LED Glowing Wake Up Kid Sleep Traine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EOp4uY-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰[Enjoy Getting Up Early! ] For 80% of adults, waking up early is a painful task, and so are children. Therefore, to prevent your child from screaming, moaning in pain and being annoyed in the morning, We have developed a multifunctional kids alarm clock with night light for your child, Who can be woken up by soft music to have a good morning. This alarm clock can adjust the color of the night light alarm clock according to your different moods. ⏰[Intelligent Control] This children's alarm clock can be controlled by APP, without cumbersome setting procedures. Just turn on the phone, you can easily customize the alarm clock, sleep training, sound, night light color and timer. The 7 soft color backlight will not dazzle you at night, and it is also very suitable for use as a night light. ⏰[Diversified Alarm Clock Modes]Our kids alarm clock features dual alarm and sleep training functions, as well as three weekday options to meet the early waking needs of both kids and adults, and we have chosen 6 different soft alarm ringtones. Compared with other alarm clocks on the market with harsh ringing tones, our music is more suitable for children, allowing them to wake up gently in their sleep. ⏰[Sunrise/Sunset Simulation]The kids alarm clock has a sunrise/sunset mode. The alarm clock will slowly change from dark to bright from morning to afternoon, allowing the children to wake up slowly in a soft light. At midnight, the night light of the children's alarm clock will automatically dim, accompany the child to sleep in the middle of the night, and provide a good sleeping environment for the child. ⏰[Solve Your Kids Travel Troubles]Our kids alarm clock uses USB data cable (included in the box), the operation is very simple, very easy for children to use, school, bedroom can be carried around , 2000ml lithium battery, ultra long standby, travel without burden","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EOp4uY-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOUCH X","source_asin":"B09PDS6JL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PDS6JL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PDS6JL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
