window.products.push({"id":424455,"name":"Rusticity® Wooden Mortar & Pestal | Mango Wood | Handmade |(5x5x4 in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lxCFMlW9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nothing can bring out the flavor in your food than the appropriate spicing. The Rusticity Mango wood Manual Mortar and Pestle Set will make the best favour for you. Create your own sauces, dressings or dips in this natural grinder with no worries about hygiene. This mixer is made of Indian Mango Wood in round shape and accompanied with a pestle for comfortable fast cooking. The use of wood not only brings the beauty of nature indoor, but it has also been found to be more hygienic than plastic. This traditional product is going to make the whole process way easier! Use this smasher to grind herbs and spices quickly and easily. Simply add anything from cloves to cumin seeds or peppercorns to the deep mortar bowl, then crush into a coarse or fine powder with a twisting and pressing motion of the pestle. This is perfect for grinding, pounding, and crushing spices, herbs, tough foods, grains, teas, garlics, and gingers. The grinder is not limited to just food but can also used for supplements and pills. This Mortar and Pestle has beautiful floral designs with flawless finish which is an attractive addition to your kitchen collection. The shinning finish of the outer and the inner area gives an elegant appeal. If your best friend’s birthday is just around the corner and you would like to offer an intimate and memorable gift, then our mortar and pestle kit is going to put large smile on your loving one’s face. It is a precious gift to show off something stylish and functional, reminding us of past times. NOTE*: Some fraudulent sellers are trying to sell this product at a much cheaper price than that of the Original Rusticity Mortal & Pestle. Kindly buy original & genuine products only from Rusticity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lxCFMlW9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rusticity","source_asin":"B07NNTWW8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NNTWW8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NNTWW8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
