window.products.push({"id":424467,"name":"Caspari Cupcakes Paper Cocktail Napkins, 20 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aXifmbjkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Adapt the elegance of a formal table setting to everyday life with luxury paper plates and napkins from Caspari. Disposability means less time spent on clean-up and more time with friends and family. Printed in Germany using non-toxic, water-soluble dyes on the softest tissue printable, these three-ply paper cocktail/dessert napkins have the feel of linen without the maintenance. They are 100-percent biodegradable and compostable, combining convenience with sustainability. The Cupcakes design celebrates any occasion with festive cupcakes on a confetti-strewn background. Sold in a pack of 20, each napkin measures 5-inch square folded and opens to 10-inch square. Caspari bringing style and convenience into your home every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aXifmbjkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B00FZXGQHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FZXGQHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FZXGQHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":424468,"name":"VECELO Modern Night Stand, Side Storage Sofa Couch and Living Room,Bedroom, End Table with Cabinet, Pink/Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lq0upy7IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For any needs our customer services always will be here to help you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lq0upy7IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VECELO","source_asin":"B09JGMFGHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JGMFGHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JGMFGHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":424469,"name":"Wine Eccentric Wine Aerator and Wine Aerator Pourer - Red and White Wine Breather-Decanter Spout Black.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AKWRF4HkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"USING THE WINE ECCENTRIC WINE AERATOR POURER WILL MAKE YOUR WINE TASTE BETTER, THAT’S A FACT! Because there’s always time for a glass of wine. The spirit of red wine is enhanced when it is allowed to breathe. The innovative Wine Eccentric Aerator Pourer uses scientific knowledge in its design to: Filter air properly through the wine achieving optimal aeration with every pour.  Ensure a smoother and more full-bodied taste with your favorite wines instantly.  Eliminate the time of having to wait for your wine to aerate in a decanter. You deserve to taste a savory wine with every sip. 100% Food Grade Acrylic. Transparent design shows the process of aeration. Beautifully designed to make pouring smoother, achieving a more rapid aeration. Detachable, easy to clean and carry. Compact and portable size making it easy to travel with. Innovative craftsmanship which fits on any bottle and serves also as a drip stopper, leaving no messy clean ups. Makes a perfect gift! The Science of Success: Wine Eccentric Aerator Pourer The secret to the Wine Eccentric Aerating Pourer lies in the science of its design, more specifically Bernoulli’s Principle. When wine is poured with the Wine Eccentric Aerator Pourer its design creates an increase in the wines velocity and decrease in its pressure. This pressure difference draws in air, which mixes with the wine to instantly improve its aroma’s, flavor and overall harmony. Whether you’re entertaining friends and family, having a dinner party or simply enjoying a glass of your favorite wine after a long day at work or on the weekend, The Wine Eccentric Aerator Pourer is right for you. WE OFFER A 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE IF YOU ARE NOT COMPLETELY SATISFIED, SO CLICK \"ORDER NOW\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AKWRF4HkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wine Eccentric","source_asin":"B00S724UOU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S724UOU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S724UOU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":424470,"name":"MAVEA Marella XL 8-Cup Water Filtration Pitcher, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YQRP3b+SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAVEA is the new generation of water filtration from Germany, bringing a new line of filters and systems to North America. MAVEA offers water filter pitcher systems with European design and styling as well as superior features. MAVEA’s Marella systems utilize MAVEA Maxtra next-generation filter technology. Available in XL (8-cup capacity) and Kompakt (5-cup capacity; designed to fit in a fridge door), Marella systems offer a flip-top lid for ease of use. Marella systems have the MAVEA MEMO Meter, a time-based meter that alerts users to change the filter based on time. The Marella is BPA Free. The material used is SAN and has been material tested and certified safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YQRP3b+SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mavea","source_asin":"B009Z569GK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009Z569GK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009Z569GK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":424471,"name":"Nutan Split Fully Assembled Bunkie Board for Mattress/Bed Support, Twin XL (Set of 2), Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":136.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b9ENq1qIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 1.5-inch Bunkie Board , Split Bunkie Board provides a surface foundation for any platform beds, bunks and daybeds. It adds support to the mattress and will keep mattress stay in good shape thus extending the life of your mattress. It will give a firm bottom support for the mattress and raises the mattress up for about 1.5 inches. When a mattress is placed directly on slats or metal spring, the mattress will have the tendency to rip or sink. These can be avoided with the use of a Bunkie board. Using a Bunkie board doubles the mattress' life expectancy. This Bunkie board is a good alternative in lieu of a box spring that may be too high for day beds. It will give the bed a lift without adding much height. This Bunkie board is strong enough to be used directly on bed frame in lieu of a box spring. It will give the mattress a lift which is a quite low but will definitely hold up the mattress. It is wrapped in a stitch bonded nonwoven fabric. It meets federal standards 1632 and 1633 fire code. This Bunkie Board will give you enduring comfort and durability for an excellent sleep. The split design will give you the convenience and easy mobility since the 2 piece varieties are very light weight utilizing 2 smaller pieces making them easier to carry and maneuver through the cramped quarters of an apartment our house. continuously aims to be the most reliable direct mattress manufacturer in the industry. With our prominent name and superior service, we satisfy customers all over. All of our products are made in the Country to ensure that you get only the best. We take great pride in the quality of our products and the quick service we provide. Our customers are our best advertisement. Customers and business partners alike have experienced Company's commitment to the unbeatable service we provide for their high quality products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b9ENq1qIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nutan","source_asin":"B0BDGYYTXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDGYYTXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDGYYTXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
