window.products.push({"id":424474,"name":"GUDWARE Extra Long Oven Mitts and Pot Holders Sets: 2 Cooking Mittens, 2 Mini Oven Gloves, 2 Hot Potholders |Non Slip Silicone, Heat Resistant to 500℉","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Oqi2w+lOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introduce an extra layer of comfort into your kitchen with GUDWARE Silicone Oven Mitts and Potholders sets designed to offer topnotch protection from heat and burns. These heat-resistant kitchen kit offers you a firm grip for handling hot pots and other cookware and also prevent heat from flames and steam from scorching your delicate skin thanks to the padded extension around your wrists and arms . The mittens have boast a honeycomb outer shell design and 100% natural cotton fabric liner for heat insulation and comfort while you cook your favorite meals and delicacies. When not in use, the integrated hanging loop makes it easy to store the oven mitts on wall hooks or kitchen racks. The Heat Resistant Kitchen Cooking Mitts and silicone trivets double as potholders and as a barrier for keeping your delicate counter tops scratch free while the pinch mitts can be used for instant grabbing of hot pots for excellent comfort while cooking. These extra thick silicone Oven Mitts and Pot Holders Sets are 100% safe for cooking. Why Choose Our Kitchen Mittens and Pot Holder Sets? 15 inches LONG version (5 inches longer than the rest) Superior extra thick silicone material Extra Thickness for better heat resistance Organic Cotton Liner for extra comfort Flexible Dishwasher safe Non-slip grip for firmer hold on utensils Resistant to stains and easy to clean Protect hands from steam and hot water Package Contents each package includes 2 x (15 x 5.5 inches) extra-long oven mitts, 2 x (4.1 x 3.3 inches) mini pinch mitts and 2 x (7 x 7 inches) silicone trivets Our sturdy and comfortable Silicone Oven Mitts sets are made using premium breathable cotton as inner lining to ensure softness, breathability and peak comfort. Gift your loved ones convenience that lasts beyond the heat of the kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Oqi2w+lOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUDWARE","source_asin":"B08T5PBFNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T5PBFNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T5PBFNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
