window.products.push({"id":424494,"name":"Terra Distribution Pour Over Coffee Dripper [ Designed in Japan ] Eco-friendly Coffee Dripper Reusing Coffee Beans' Waste as Raw Material (Coffee Make","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E-itxAhkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[ Eco-friendly ] Feel guilty for throwing away grounded coffee beans' waste? Well, not anymore! This coffee pour over is reusing grounded coffee beans' waste to mix with plastic pellets as raw materials, thus, reducing the amount of plastic required by 20% while making use of grounded coffee beans' waste! [ Natural Color ] Believe it or not, the dark brown color of this coffee dripper and its measuring spoon is coming from the color of the grounded coffee beans' waste mixed with plastic pellets! This stylish natural color coffee dripper is a must-have item for any coffee lover! Due to its naturalness and natural texture, each individual is unique and may see some tiny dots mixed in its plastic body. [ Super Light ] The coffee pour over only weighs 2.36oz (67g) and is ultra-light compared with ceramic, glass, or even plastic-made coffee drippers. Thus, easy to carry around for your camping, traveling, or other and do not have to worry about breakage by dropping. This super lightweight also helps to reduce CO2 during transportation by requiring less energy during shipping. [ Imported from Japan ] This coffee drip is designed and sold in the market in Japan, which is then, imported here, assuring its quality by strict inspection. (The product is made by a cooperating factory in ROC.) [ Size, Weight and Material ] Brews 1-4 cup, Suitable for size 02 - 04 paper filter (**Size 04 may fit better. ** Not included.) Dripper: 3.54 x 5.91 x 5.12 inch ( 9 x 15 x 13 cm) 2.36 oz ( 67 g)　Measuring spoon: Length 4.33 inch (11 cm ) 0.11 oz ( 3 g) Material: PP with grounded coffee beans","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E-itxAhkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Terra Distribution","source_asin":"B09ZNP3X49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZNP3X49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZNP3X49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
