window.products.push({"id":424530,"name":"Steve's Gift Shoppe Large Cedar Keepsake and Treasure Storage Box - Size 14 x 7 x 6 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n+c44uvOL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Cedar Keepsake Box 14 L x 7 W x 6 H Inches offers a convenient and attractive place to hide your treasures, papers, nick-knacks, jewelry, etc. Made from natural Western red cedar, this cedar box is attractive and protects its contents. It comes with a stylishly routed lid (top) that creates interest without distracting from the clean, classic lines of the box and the warm, natural grain of the cedar. It is both a traditional keepsake box and a foray into the modern. This elegant keepsake box is classically designed, fitting well in your home or office. Keep it at your beside or on your dresser. Functional and decorative, use your Cedar Keepsake Box to keep your favorite things out of sight but in reach. This product is ideal for both men and women and it is the kind of storage box that focuses on what counts-the memories inside. Cedar is a favorite wood for closets, hangers, and any kind of storage. Why? Because cedar is a naturally aromatic wood that has some wonderful properties and it is naturally resistant to moisture in the air, making it perfect to use for trunks, chests and keepsake boxes. Cedar is also renowned as a pest repellent, which means that your Cedar Keepsake Box protects your things on many levels. These boxes are beautifully made-and made in the U.S.A by Steve's Gift Shoppe. Matte finish shellac outside and unfinished cedar inside, which creates beauty and natural cedar wood grain. Cedar has interesting wood grain features and no two keepsake boxes will be quite the same. Photo shown is a stock photo and the piece you receive will have different wood grain features. CUSTOM SIZES AVAILABLE. OPTIONAL - IF YOU WANT TO PUT ON YOUR OWN FINISH, LET US KNOW VIA AMAZON MESSAGING WHEN YOU ORDER.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n+c44uvOL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Steve's Gift Shoppe","source_asin":"B01MCU39S6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MCU39S6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MCU39S6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
