window.products.push({"id":424697,"name":"Leather Recliner Chair Modern Rocker with Heated Massage Ergonomic Lounge 360 Degree Swivel Single Sofa Seat with Drink Holders & Side Pockets, Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":389.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QeaYwcTdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OVERSIZED RECLINER CHAIR DIMENSIONS: 38.19W x 37.4D x 38.58H '' (length 63 in fully reclined position) Extra Wide Recliner : Seat 23 \" W × 22\" D ✨Relax in this recliner chair with reclining, rocking, massage, heated and swiveling features MASSAGE & HEATING FUNCTION: Try this remote heated massage chair full body and recliner. Multiple massage models for 4 body zones and 8 points by remote control will take away the stress of daily life, lumbar heated also is good for blood circulation. 4 massage zones, each zone can be operated individually. Both can be turned off at a fixed time of 15 or 30 minutes 360 DEGREE SWIVEL RECLINER: Enjoy the scenery outside the window, fancy watching a movie, well this is the ideal swivel sofa chair, just think turn this recliner chair. Your favorite drink, place it in the cup holder, recline to your preferred position. Watch, relax, drinking and enjoy 160 DEGREE RECLINE FEATURES: High quality push back recliner mechanism, place your hands on the arm rests of the recliner and in conjunction with pulling the side rings lean backwards using your body weight to recline the living room chair ROCKS GENTLY: This rocking chair such thoughtful design is very suitable for relaxing or babies nursery, relieving your fatigue of the day effectively 2 CUP HOLDERS AND SIDE STORAGE BAGS: The single reclining sofa with drink holders has been developed to the highest standards, providing strength, durability and supreme comfort COMFORTABLY PADDED: Gives comfort and support where it's needed the most. This massage sofa accompanies you on busy workdays and lazy weekends INSTALLATION GUIDE: The armrests of this sofa are indeed a bit complicated and confusing to install. So we recorded an installation video in advance to provide guidance, hope it helps you. If you have any problem with our reclining chair, please feel free to contact us NOTE: The massage recliner chair backrest does not need to be adjusted by electric power, just lie down to present the recliner state, when you sit up, the backrest will automatically pop back NOTE: It is normal for slightly wrinkled on the surface of the PU leather sofa when take it out because of the vacuum-packed. Gently tapping,hot air or normally use a period of time will help reduce folds. In general, the surface folds will gradually return to flat after 3-10 uses. The folds can also be acceleratedly removed by low heating with a hair dryer (the temperature is appropriate)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QeaYwcTdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KCREAM","source_asin":"B0B72HD5VX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B72HD5VX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B72HD5VX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
