window.products.push({"id":424953,"name":"tackspace Power Lift Recliner Chair for Elderly, Safe Slow Lift Motor, Breathable and Soft Faux Leather with Side Pocket, USB Port and Remote Control ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mHzyWTxHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LIFT ASSISTANCE WITH SILENT MOTOR】Power lift recliner's motor with FCC and UL certification makes for quiet, smooth operation and slow power movement, pushes the entire chair up from its base without adding stress to back or knees, securely assists you from a sitting to standing position, which is an especially good option for seniors or people, who are recovering from surgery 【SOFT UPHOLSTERY AND STURDY MECHANISM】TACKspace power lift chair is covered in high-quality breathable leather, which is extremely durable and easy to clean. High-density sponge overstuffed in the chair and hardwood seat box with sinuous steel springs provides sturdy and stable support up to 330LBS 【COMFORTABLE SITTING EXPERIENCE】Wired remote gives the infinite options to find your most comfortable position from 45°- 160°. Just press a button to fully relax and recline, eliminating gaps and providing full-body support, all the way back to the zero-gravity position, which provides a premium sitting experience 【CONVENIENT DESIGN】A convenient side pocket stores your belongings - including the remote control. The USB charging port is designed for charging phones or tablets within an easy reach just aside from the remote (Note: The USB port is only for Low-Power devices, such as Phone, iPad or Headset.) 【OVERALL SIZE AND EASY ASSEMBLY】Lift recliner measures 36''W × 38.5''D × 40''H with a 62'' fully reclined length, more suitable for people from 5.1' to 5.6' tall. This lift chair is easy to assemble in 15 minutes, simply slide parts into metal slots without any tools DELIVERY: The lift chair comes in 2 boxes and we ship them on the same day but the carrier may deliver them to your door on different days","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mHzyWTxHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"tackspace","source_asin":"B09CPB2R3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CPB2R3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CPB2R3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":424954,"name":"VVA Round Tablecloth - Beach Sea Landscape with Palm Tree Leaves, Clouds and Tropical Ocean Sand - Round Table Cover for Dining Rooms and Kitchens, In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812pT8VBMcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[TABLECLOTH FOR ROUND TABLES] - Great tablecloth for indoors and outdoors, perfect for all holidays and events. The cover displays lively imagery is perfect for your table. Decorate your tabletop for holiday, dinner or parties. ***Attention - the tablecloth size is NOT the table size. DO NOT forget the OVERHANG, please measure your table’s size before buying. [PREMIUM QUALITY ROUND TABLECLOTH] - VVA fitted tablecloths for round tables are made of 100% polyester skin friendly fabric, printed with high quality, high resolution images and feature a casual lightweight drape. Top quality cloth and exquisite workmanship ensure its anti-fading and shrinking resistance, and long-lasting durability. Its stain and wrinkle resistance features add a classy touch to any plain table, giving it seamless beauty. [SPILL PROOF & STAIN RESISTANT] - Our holiday table cloth is oil-proof, stain proof, scratch and water resistant. Leak proof, making it the perfect cover protector for your table. Great for home decor and families with kids and pets, helps avoid unexpected troubles and provides you with the greatest convenience. Machine washable in cold water. Reusable, easy to clean and maintain. Air dry or tumble dry on low. Warm ironing if needed. No bleaching. [VERSATILE TABLE PROTECTOR] - How to create the perfect dining atmosphere? The table cover is perfect for indoor/outdoor use, specially designed to match your holidays (such as CHRISTMAS, THANKSGIVING, HALLOWEEN and so on), weddings, BBQs, picnics, celebrations, catering events, cafes, special occasions, dinners, brunches, potlucks, buffets or party themes. [VIBRANT COLOR & BLUNDERING SIZE] - We offer unique design featuring vibrant colors and interesting patterns of pictures specializing fit for circular. They doesn’t cause any unpleasant odor. The images on the clothes are so VIBRANT and HIGH-DEFINITION, and resilient fabric won’t fade, rip or weather. This 60 inch is Tablecloth size.It is NOT the TABLE size. Recommended table size 28-43 Inches. Table size should be LESS THAN Tablecloth size, please measure your table size before buying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812pT8VBMcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VVA","source_asin":"B0836SRPKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-424954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0836SRPKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0836SRPKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
